        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Kharuunge Babiloni ne bamenywa bamwo enywe ne muloleleele. Khakhole ndio sikila bumayaanu bwoosi nibwo bakhola mu Sayuni.",
